sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State(s): N/a

    CSMS->>CS: TriggerMessageRequest (requestedMessage = MeterValues, evse.id = <Configured evseId>)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: requestedMessage must be MeterValues<br>evse.id must be <Configured evseId>
    CS-->>CSMS: TriggerMessageResponse (status = Accepted)

    CS->>CSMS: MeterValuesRequest (evseId = <Configured evseId>, meterValue[0].sampledValue.context = Trigger)
    CSMS-->>CS: MeterValuesResponse

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
